# List pagination (VCP)

When adding or changing a **list / index** page:

1. Use `LIST_PAGE_SIZE` (tables/rows) or `COMPANIES_PAGE_SIZE` (admin
   company cards) + helpers from `src/list_page.rs` (`?page=`, 1-based).
2. With filter chips: pager on the same `vb-chip-row` (right). Chip hrefs omit `page`.
3. Without chips: `vb-list-toolbar` above the table, pager right.
4. Pager = SSR `<a href>` only — no client JS pager.
5. Live-search shards take `page` and reset to 1 when the query signal changes.
6. Ship the full test pyramid for that surface (see `web-stack` § List pagination).
